    "audio_page_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reels/audio/800756877431507/",
    "audio_status": "credited_song",
    "caption": "“Levitating” by Dua Lipa, released on October 1, 2020 through Warner Records as the fifth single from her second studio album Future Nostalgia — ￼ and it was actually the very first song recorded for the album. She started here. And it became everything. 🚀🔥\n\nAfter figuring out the sound she desired for Future Nostalgia, Dua Lipa began working backwards — and “Levitating” was the first track recorded that made the album’s final cut. ￼ A song that set the entire blueprint for one of the greatest pop albums of the decade. The foundation. The blueprint. The moment everything clicked. 💙✨\n\n“Levitating” made history as the longest-charting Billboard Hot 100 hit ever among women ￼ — and was crowned the number one Billboard Hot 100 song of the entire year 2021. It also became the first Diamond-certified hit by a female vocalist of the decade — the RIAA’s highest possible certification. ￼ Disco-pop, zero gravity, and a record that simply refused to land. 👑🌍\n\n🌟 If you wanna run away with me — “Levitating” is Dua Lipa at her most joyful, most unstoppable and most iconic — a song that floated to the top of every chart and never came back down. 🎶\n\n⚠️ Copyright Notice: Shared for fan appreciation only. All rights belong to Dua Lipa and Warner Records. If you are the original rights holder and wish to have this removed, please DM us immediately. 🙏\n\n#dualipa #liveperformance #livemusic #stageperformance #foryou",
